there are a few things more upsetting  than the idea of a lonely death to pass  off the mortal coil without anyone  around you anyone to comfort you in your  final moments thankfully  scp-4999 exists to help solve this  tragic issue  scp-4999 is a humanoid who appears  dressed in dark formal wear he manifests  as the side of fatally injured  critically ill or otherwise dying people  within the last 20 minutes of their life  he will only appear to those dying alone  sitting or standing with them if no  chair is available in an act of what  seems like silent respect next he'll  pull out two cigarettes one for himself  and one for his dying friend he'll then  hold their hand place a hand on their  shoulder or engage in some other kind of  comforting physical touch in their final  moments then disappear shortly after the  person has passed leaving no trace that  he was ever there except for the left  behind cigarette while no one is exactly  sure what he is or why he's chosen to  keep his vigil thanks to scp-4999  nobody ever really dies alone
 

